    "innovation": "This work demonstrates that increasing the tropical ocean resolution to 0.25\u00b0 in the ECHAM6-FESOM climate model significantly improves the simulation of the Equatorial Pacific, reducing sea surface temperature biases and leading to more realistic ENSO statistics and a better-represented annual cycle compared to a standard 1\u00b0 grid.",
